---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Work Companion — Design Decisions">
  <article class="project">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="crumb"><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}projects/work-companion`}>Work Companion</a></p>
      <h1>Design decisions</h1>

      <nav class="actions">
        <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}projects/work-companion/learnings`} class="btn">Learnings</a>
        <span class="btn current">Design decisions</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/alawal1/work-companion" class="btn">⌥ Code</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section>
      <p>
        <ol>
          <li>Manual triggers only (“wrap up”, “where was I”) &#x2192; I work occasionally on my private projects, no regular or fixed hours.</li>
          <li>The agent writes straight to Notion and shows what changed &#x2192; approving every change would bring back the logging effort you wanted to avoid.</li>
          <li>Claude interviewed me one question at a time before designing anything &#x2192; ensures the design meets my actual needs (need analysis)</li>
        </ol>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
